+	 * Apple 27" 5K dual-tile internal panel (iMac15,1 / 17,1 / 18,3 / 19,1 / 20,x / iMacPro1,1).
+	 * iMac15,1? family: AE01 root-compat, AE02 tile identity
+	 * iMac17,1 family: AE05 root-compat, AE06 tile identity
+	 * iMac18,3 family: AE11 root-compat, AE12 tile identity
+	 * iMac Pro family: AE1D root-compat, AE1E tile identity
+	 * iMac19,1? family: AE25 root-compat, AE26 tile identity
+	 * iMac20,x family: AE31 root-compat, AE32 tile identity
+	 * Role discrimination is by connector_signal (eDP=root, DP=secondary) — not by
